Item agreed to.
Customs tariff-456a. Ingot moulds for use in the production of steel:	British preferential tariff, free;
Intermediate tariff, 5 per cent; General tariff, 7^ per cent.

Item agreed to.
Customs tariff-506a. Crutches or specially constructed staffs for a cripple:	British preferential tariff, free;
Intermediate tariff, free; General tariff, free.
